
## Running on the phone (no SMS)
- Before starting Metro, set EXPO_PUBLIC_PAKSHO_UI_PREVIEW=1 so the app shows an SMS-free preview login next to the real login.
- PowerShell: $env:EXPO_PUBLIC_PAKSHO_UI_PREVIEW="1"; npx expo start --port 8081
- Both apps are already installed on the test phone; do not rebuild or reinstall, only start Metro.

